# No guide gives a rotation for Sandrone / Odette / Sucrose / Vodyanitsa
# (LDShop, wishgm, enjoygm, Gaming ProMax and AllThingsHow list it;
# enjoygm: play Vodyanitsa "exactly as in the Vesna team: Skill, leave").
# Rotation of the Sandrone / Odette / Sucrose / Cryo Traveler team
# (teams/sandrone-odette-sucrose-travelercryo, the KQM Sandrone quick
# guide's Stellar Swirl team) with Vodyanitsa E in the Traveler's place:
# Odette 2[E](Q) > Sucrose N1 ED (Q) > Vodyanitsa E > Sandrone C E >
# Sucrose N1 ED > Sandrone [combo]
# Odette and Sucrose burst when ready. Sandrone's C0 combo 3[C E] (Q),
# the burst after the first skill.
active odette;
odette skill:2;
if .odette.burst.ready {
  odette burst;
}
sucrose attack, skill, dash;
if .sucrose.burst.ready {
  sucrose burst;
}
vodyanitsa skill;
sandrone charge, skill;
sucrose attack, skill, dash;
sandrone charge, skill, burst,
         charge, skill,
         charge, skill;
